%U A401090 640885388175439936,30157986095884710593,1515516524148232566144,81001951622070231171421,4588937276666111125878160
%N A401090 Total number of minimal edge covers in all labeled trees on n vertices.
%H A401090 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A401090/b401090.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..300</a>
%H A401090 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/MinimalEdgeCover.html">Minimal Edge Cover</a>.
%o A401090 (PARI) seq(n)={my(u=v=w=O(x)); for(n=1, n, my(t=x*exp(u+v)); u=v*t; v=t*(exp(w)-1); w=t); Vec(serlaplace(intformal((u + v)/x)), -n)}
%Y A401090 Cf. A399451, A399455.
%K A401090 nonn,new
